{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hey, I'm Ken Sharma, nice to meet you.","I work at Anthropic as an engineering manager, been there since May 2024.","I live in Denver, born on May 26, by the way.","Just so you know, I have a sister named Chloe Kovač.","Alright, I want you to always keep my answers short and concise, got it?"],"conveyed":["s0f0","s0f1","s0f2","s0f3","s0f4","s0f5","s0f6"]},{"session":1,"messages":["I've been into photography lately, it's really relaxing.","I used to love cold brew but now I'm all about black coffee, just like that.","My music taste changed too, from lo-fi beats to jazz.","I know Go, Rust, and TypeScript, pretty good with those.","Also, I'm really into birdwatching in my free time."],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4","s1f5","s1f6"]},{"session":2,"messages":["Just wanted to let you know, I left Anthropic in October 2025.","Started working at Ramp as an engineering manager, same role though.","The transition was pretty smooth, actually.","Ramp's a great company, really enjoying it so far."],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Guess what? I moved to Austin in October 2025, previously lived in Denver.","The weather's definitely different here, much hotter.","Denver was nice but Austin has its own vibe, you know?","Still adjusting to the humidity, though."],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["My manager's name is Tom, he's pretty cool.","He manages the Payments team, which I'm part of.","The team uses Swift for development, interesting language.","Working on payments has been challenging but rewarding."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Finished Project Falcon back in February 2026, feels like yesterday.","Now I'm working on Project Atlas, it's coming along nicely.","Oh, and I also wrapped up Project Fable in May 2026.","Projects, projects, projects - that's my life these days."],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["On September 21, 2025, I rebuilt the CI pipeline, what a day that was.","May 17, 2026, I organized a hackathon, it was pretty successful.","The team really came together for that one.","Hackathons are exhausting but so rewarding when they work out."],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["April 26, 2025 was a big day - I deployed the payment service.","January 9, 2026, I ran a marathon, crazy right?","Switched to jazz for music, been loving it lately.","The marathon training was tough but worth every moment."],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
